  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة الواقعة مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 96، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة الواقعة</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056001.mp3');\">إِذَا وَقَعَتِ الْوَاقِعَةُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056002.mp3');\">لَيْسَ لِوَقْعَتِهَا كَاذِبَةٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056003.mp3');\">خَافِضَةٌ رَّافِعَةٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056004.mp3');\">إِذَا رُجَّتِ الْأَرْضُ رَجًّا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056005.mp3');\">وَبُسَّتِ الْجِبَالُ بَسًّا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056006.mp3');\">فَكَانَتْ هَبَاءً مُّنبَثًّا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056007.mp3');\">وَكُنتُمْ أَزْوَاجًا ثَلَاثَةً <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056008.mp3');\">فَأَصْحَابُ الْمَيْمَنَةِ مَا أَصْحَابُ الْمَيْمَنَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [8]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056009.mp3');\">وَأَصْحَابُ الْمَشْأَمَةِ مَا أَصْحَابُ الْمَشْأَمَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [9]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056010.mp3');\">وَالسَّابِقُونَ السَّابِقُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [10]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056011.mp3');\">أُولَٰئِكَ الْمُقَرَّبُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [11]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056012.mp3');\">فِي جَنَّاتِ النَّعِيمِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [12]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056013.mp3');\">ثُلَّةٌ مِّنَ الْأَوَّلِينَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [13]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056014.mp3');\">وَقَلِيلٌ مِّنَ الْآخِرِينَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [14]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056015.mp3');\">عَلَىٰ سُرُرٍ مَّوْضُونَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [15]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056016.mp3');\">مُّتَّكِئِينَ عَلَيْهَا مُتَقَابِلِينَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [16]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056017.mp3');\">يَطُوفُ عَلَيْهِمْ وِلْدَانٌ مُّخَلَّدُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [17]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056018.mp3');\">بِأَكْوَابٍ وَأَبَارِيقَ وَكَأْسٍ مِّن مَّعِينٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [18]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056019.mp3');\">لَّا يُصَدَّعُونَ عَنْهَا وَلَا يُنزِفُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [19]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056020.mp3');\">وَفَاكِهَةٍ مِّمَّا يَتَخَيَّرُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [20]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056021.mp3');\">وَلَحْمِ طَيْرٍ مِّمَّا يَشْتَهُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [21]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056022.mp3');\">وَحُورٌ عِينٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [22]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056023.mp3');\">كَأَمْثَالِ اللُّؤْلُؤِ الْمَكْنُونِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [23]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056024.mp3');\">جَزَاءً بِمَا كَانُوا يَعْمَلُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [24]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056025.mp3');\">لَا يَسْمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغْوًا وَلَا تَأْثِيمًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الواقعة [25]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/056026.mp3');\">إِلَّا قِيلًا سَلَامًا سَلَامًا <span class